<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/21/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "seksyen 3A, seksyen baru 3B yang berikut: \"Additional 3B. (1) In addition to the functions provided function of under this Act, the authority may, with the the authority. 'approval of the Minister, operate any port-related activities. (2) In the exercise of the function in subsection (1) the authority may expend such moneys as are necessary. (3) For the purposes of this section, \"port- related activities\" means— (a) activities performed outside a port which relate to any function or duty of the authority or to operate or maintain a port or the transportation of goods through the port; or (b) the development, operation or maintenance outside the port of marinas and other pro- perties necessary for the furtherance of any function or duty of the authority.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/21/msa@> .
